    <DataNode elementId="Man7GlcNAc2-protein-A123B2" textLabel="Man₇GlcNAc₂-[protein] (isomer 7A₁,₂,₃B₂)" type="Metabolite">
      <Graphics centerX="561.73291015625" centerY="1433.005859375" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="3955e7" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="3955e7" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="PMN, zhang, SRI, caspi">This is one of four isomers of Man&lt;sub&gt;7&lt;/sub&gt;GlcNAc&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt; chains that are found in &lt;i&gt;N&lt;/i&gt; glycans. The nomenclature used to identify high mannose glycans has not been standardized. Several earlier systems were insufficient to describe all possible isomers |CITS: [7954510][17719235][17685584]|. The nomenclature used here is that proposed by Prien et al |CITS: [19181540]|, which can represent all processing isomers. According to this nomenclature, the other three Man&lt;sub&gt;7&lt;/sub&gt;GlcNAc&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt; isomers are named |FRAME: Man7GlcNAc2-protein-A123B3 &quot;isomer 7A&lt;sub&gt;1,2,3&lt;/sub&gt;B&lt;sub&gt;3&lt;/sub&gt;&quot;|, |FRAME: Man7GlcNAc2-protein-A123B1 &quot;isomer 7A&lt;sub&gt;1,2,3&lt;/sub&gt;B&lt;sub&gt;1&lt;/sub&gt;&quot;| and |FRAME: Man7GlcNAc2-protein-A12B12 &quot;isomer 7A&lt;sub&gt;1,2&lt;/sub&gt;B&lt;sub&gt;1,2&lt;/sub&gt;&quot;|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="Man7GlcNAc2-protein-A123B2" />
      <Property key="Synonym_1" value="a [(mannosyl)&lt;sub&gt;7&lt;/sub&gt;(&lt;i&gt;N&lt;/i&gt;-acetylglucosaminyl)&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;]-L-asparaginyl-[protein] (isomer 7A&lt;sub&gt;1,2,3&lt;/sub&gt;B&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;)" />
      <Property key="Synonym_2" value="an &amp;alpha;-D-Man-(1&amp;rarr;2)-&amp;alpha;-D-Man-(1&amp;rarr;3)-[&amp;alpha;-D-Man-(1&amp;rarr;2)-&amp;alpha;-D-Man-(1&amp;rarr;3)-[&amp;alpha;-D-Man-(1&amp;rarr;6)]-&amp;alpha;-D-Man-(1&amp;rarr;6)]-&amp;beta;-D-Man-(1&amp;rarr;4)-&amp;beta;-D-GlcNAc-(1&amp;rarr;4)-&amp;beta;-D-GlcNAc-1-L-asparaginyl-[protein]" />
      <Property key="GroupCoords2d" value="(249 145), NIL, (197 145), NIL, (145 145), (93 145), (41 145), (145 93), (145 41), (93 41), (93 93), (301 145)" />
