      <Comment source="PMN, zhang, SRI, caspi">This is one of three isomers of Man&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;GlcNAc&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt; chains that are found in &lt;i&gt;N&lt;/i&gt; glycans. The nomenclature used to identify high mannose glycans has not been standardized. Several earlier systems were insufficient to describe all possible isomers |CITS: [7954510][17719235][17685584]|. The nomenclature used here is that proposed by Prien et al |CITS: [19181540]|, which can represent all processing isomers. According to this nomenclature, the other two Man&lt;sub&gt;8&lt;/sub&gt;GlcNAc&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt; isomers are named |FRAME: Man8GlcNAc2-protein-A123B13 &quot;isomer 8A&lt;sub&gt;1,2,3&lt;/sub&gt;B&lt;sub&gt;1,3&lt;/sub&gt;&quot;| and |FRAME: Man8GlcNAc2-protein-A123B23 &quot;isomer 8A&lt;sub&gt;1,2,3&lt;/sub&gt;B&lt;sub&gt;2,3&lt;/sub&gt;&quot;|.</Comment>
